  unitName: Rose Sibyl Paula
  unitId: 30244
  unitNumber: 396
  description: The youngest of the Six Sibyl Sisters. Seeing how some humans would
    sacrifice their weaker allies for their own benefit she decided to stop protecting
    them and instead join the fight against them. She committed the same cruel acts
    against them that they seemed capable of committing against others. It's recorded
    that the innocent looking smile she wore as she stained the flowers she commanded
    red with blood led to her being particularly feared even among the other Fresh
    Blood Sisters.
  summonDesc: How conceited of you to<br>go and summon me!<br>I'm gonna tell my sisters!
  fusionDesc: You remind me of the sun!<br>Are there really good humans?<br>Hmm...who
    knows!
  evoDesc: My flower has turned red.<br>It's the color of human blood.<br>Heh, want
    to turn red yourself?
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
